    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This report summarizes the Stanford work done as part of Phase VI of the Kajima-\r\nCUREE Joint Research Program. It is concerned with contributions to the process of\r\npredicting collapse of frame structures under seismic excitations. The work focused on\r\nthe following two tasks.\r\n\r\nTask 1: Quantification of modeling parameters for deteriorating components.\r\n\r\nand\r\n\r\nTask 2: Case studies on the effects of deterioration on the response of a steel frame\r\nstructure till collapse",
            "type": "abstract",
            "identifier": [],
            "note": [],
            "appliesTo": []
        },
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Lignos, Dimitrios and Krawinkler, Helmut. (2007). Contributions to Collapse Prediction for Frame Structures. CUREE-Kajima Research Report CKVI-02. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at: http://purl.stanford.edu/qf341nz2474",
